<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Pages on Svtter's Blog</title><link>https://svtter.cn/page/</link><description>Recent content in Pages on Svtter's Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://svtter.cn/page/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>咨询与合作</title><link>https://svtter.cn/services/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://svtter.cn/services/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;我长期在做 AI 评审与 agent 工程,维护着自己的生产级系统(私有部署,欢迎私聊演示)。如果你在这些方向上有具体问题,可以聊:&lt;/p&gt;
